onnxruntime-prebuilt provides CMake targets (official Microsoft ONNX Runtime binaries):

    find_package(onnxruntime-prebuilt CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE onnxruntime-prebuilt::onnxruntime)

Copy ${ONNXRUNTIME_PREBUILT_RUNTIME_FILES} next to the executable (onnxruntime.dll and
onnxruntime_providers_shared.dll on Windows). Disable ORT telemetry with Ort::Env::DisableTelemetryEvents().
